       rreeaallppaatthh [_O_P_T_I_O_N]... _F_I_L_E...

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       Print  the resolved absolute file name; all but the last component must
       exist

       --ee, ----ccaannoonniiccaalliizzee--eexxiissttiinngg
              all components of the path must exist

       --mm, ----ccaannoonniiccaalliizzee--mmiissssiinngg
              no path components need exist or be a directory

       --LL, ----llooggiiccaall
              resolve '..' components before symlinks

       --PP, ----pphhyyssiiccaall
              resolve symlinks as encountered (default)

       --qq, ----qquuiieett
              suppress most error messages

       ----rreellaattiivvee--ttoo=_D_I_R
              print the resolved path relative to DIR

       ----rreellaattiivvee--bbaassee=_D_I_R
              print absolute paths unless paths below DIR

       --ss, ----ssttrriipp, ----nnoo--ssyymmlliinnkkss
              don't expand symlinks

